  "privacy": "Privacy policy",
  "privacyText": "Effective date: 1 November 2026\nDeveloper: Tidy Nook (individual developer, Turkey)\n\nTidy Nook does not collect, store or share any personal data.\n\nData we collect\n\nNone. The game has no accounts, sign-up, ads, analytics or third-party services. The app does not request internet access and never connects to the internet.\n\nWhat stays on your device\n\nYour game progress is saved only on your own device: completed levels, the furniture styles you picked, your daily box streak, and your language and sound settings. None of it is sent to us.\n\n• You can erase it all with Settings > Reset progress.\n• Uninstalling the app erases it all.\n• If Google backup is turned on for your phone, Android may back this data up to your Google account. Google manages that backup; we have no access to it.\n\nChildren\n\nThe game collects no personal information from anyone, children included.\n\nChanges\n\nIf this policy changes, the new version is published with a new effective date.\n\nContact\n\nQuestions: nilkaren.tuncay.demir@gmail.com",
